"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "link": 616, "label": "text3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text3"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 420, "type": "ttN concat", "properties": {"ttNnodeVersion": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ttN concat"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "concat", "links": [633], "label": "concat", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "concat"}], "size": [400, 220], "pos": [-979.9498291015625, 12507.0791015625], "widgets_values": ["，故事板时长为", "", "秒.", ","], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "label": "text1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 632, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "label": "text3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text3"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 425, "type": "ttN concat", "properties": {"ttNnodeVersion": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ttN concat"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [632], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-1070.400146484375, 12453.3701171875], "widgets_values": ["15"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 413, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [928.3095703125, 794.0306396484375], "pos": [1518.3260498046875, 11528.8759765625], "widgets_values": ["### A) 场景分析 (Scene Breakdown)\n\n*   **关键主体 (Subjects):**\n    *   **A (主角):** 一位拥有亮青色双马尾长发的女性。\n    *   **服饰:** 穿着一件带有亮片/闪光材质的银色/浅蓝无袖上衣，领口有荷叶边，系着一条青色领带。下身是黑色与青色拼接的短裙。\n    *   **配饰:** 佩戴着带有红色发光条带的大型头戴式耳机。\n    *   **动作:** 身体前倾，伸出左手向镜头前方，手掌张开，手指自然舒展，仿佛要触碰屏幕或邀请观众。眼神直视镜头，表情专注且略带诱惑力。\n*   **环境 (Environment):**\n    *   **背景:** 昏暗的工业或科技感环境。左侧和右后方可见大型机械臂或金属结构的模糊轮廓，带有冷色调的反射光泽。\n    *   **光影:** 主要是冷色调的人造光源。主光似乎来自上方和前方，照亮了面部和手部，形成了清晰的高光（特别是头发和衣服上的亮片）。背景有深蓝色的氛围光，营造出赛博朋克般的氛围。\n*   **视觉锚点 (Visual Anchors):**\n    *   **色彩:** 青色（发色、领带）、银色（衣服）、黑色（背景/裙）、红色（耳机发光条）。\n    *   **材质:** 头发的丝滑感、衣服的金属/亮片反光质感、皮肤的细腻感。\n    *   **构图:** 强烈的透视感，手部位于前景虚化，人物位于中景清晰，背景深邃。\n\n---\n\n### B) 主题与故事 (Theme & Story)\n\n*   **主题 (Theme):** 在充满科技感的霓虹光影中，通过极具张力的肢体语言，展现女性角色的魅力与神秘互动。\n*   **Logline (故事梗概):** 一位身着未来感服饰的虚拟偶像或仿生人，在机械丛林的背景下，向镜头发出无声的邀请。\n*   **情感弧线 (Emotional Arc):**\n    1.  **铺垫 (Setup):** 静态展示，强调角色的精致外表和神秘氛围。\n    2.  **构建 (Build):** 手部动作开始进入画面，产生视觉焦点的推拉，引导视线。\n    3.  **转折 (Turn):** 极近距离的指尖特写，带来强烈的压迫感和沉浸感。\n    4.  **高潮/回报 (Payoff):** 眼神与手势的完美同步，定格在最具吸引力的瞬间。\n\n---\n\n### C) 电影拍摄手法 (Cinematic Approach)\n\n*   **镜头推进策略:** 采用从环境展示到微观特写的“由远及近”策略。从展示人物与环境的关系，迅速推进到手部动作，最后聚焦于指尖，以此增强视觉冲击力。\n*   **摄影机运动计划:**\n    *   **KF1-2 (环境/中景):** 缓慢的推镜头 (Slow Dolly In)，配合轻微的手持晃动感，增加临场感。\n    *   **KF3 (手部特写):** 快速推进 (Crash Zoom) 或 焦点切换 (Rack Focus)，从人物脸部快速切到手部特写，强调动作。\n    *   **KF4 (指尖微距):** 极慢的缓慢推进 (Micro Dolly In)，营造一种指尖即将触碰到镜头的张力。\n*   **镜头与曝光建议:**\n    *   **焦距:** 35mm - 50mm (环境/中景)，85mm - 135mm (特写/微距)。\n    *   **景深:** 广角/中焦段使用中等景深，特写镜头使用浅景深 (Shallow DoF) 以产生漂亮的背景虚化 (Bokeh)。\n    *   **快门:** 保持 180度快门角，动作流畅，但在特写镜头中可适当提高快门速度以捕捉手部动态模糊，增加速度感。\n*   **光与色:**\n    *   **色调:** 保持冷酷的蓝青色基调 (Cyan/Blue Teal)，但在人物面部和手部高光处保留暖色反光，形成冷暖对比。\n    *   **质感:** 强调金属、塑料和皮肤的光泽感，后期增加轻微的电影颗粒 (Grain) 以提升质感。\n\n---\n\n### D) 关键帧列表 (Keyframes List)\n\n*注意：最终生成的图片中不会包含文字，文字仅为给您的描述标签。*\n\n#### **KF1**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 中景 (Medium Shot - MS)\n*   **构图:** 人物位于画面中心偏右，身体微侧，左手在画面左前景处伸出。背景是虚化的机械结构。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 静态站立，左手刚刚伸出，准备开始动作。眼神直视前方。\n*   **摄影:** 平视角度，缓慢推镜头 (Dolly In) 5%。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 35mm，中景深。焦点在人物面部和手部。\n*   **光影/风格:** 冷色调环境光，衣服上的亮片闪烁。\n\n#### **KF2**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 中近景 (Medium Close-Up - MCU)\n*   **构图:** 画面拉近，人物肩部以上入画。手部动作更加清晰，手指开始微微张开。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 手部的“花手”动作开始，手指进行小幅度的摆动。\n*   **摄影:** 继续缓慢推进，配合手部动作有微小的横向平移 (Pan)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，景深稍浅，背景机械结构虚化更明显。\n*   **光影/风格:** 保持冷色，强调眼部的高光。\n\n#### **KF3**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 特写 (Close-Up - CU)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦于伸出的手部。手位于画面前景，手指细节清晰可见，背景的人物面部虚化。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 手部动作幅度变大，手指灵活摆动，形成视觉中心。\n*   **摄影:** 焦点从人物脸部“拉”到手部 (Rack Focus)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，浅景深，背景呈现美丽的焦外虚化。\n*   **光影/风格:** 手部受光均匀，展现皮肤质感。\n\n#### **KF4**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 大特写 (Extreme Close-Up - ECU)\n*   **构图:** 极度聚焦于指尖或手掌的局部细节。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 指尖微微颤动，仿佛要穿透屏幕。\n*   **摄影:** 极缓慢的推进 (Micro Dolly In)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 100mm以上，极浅景深，只有指尖清晰。\n*   **光影/风格:** 强烈的特写质感，光影对比强烈。\n\n#### **KF5**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 低角度中景 (Low Angle Medium Shot)\n*   **构图:** 从极低的角度仰拍，人物显得高大、具有压迫感。手部在画面上方形成前景。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 人物保持前倾姿势，手部动作更具侵略性。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头位置固定，模拟仰视视角的冲击力。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 24mm，深景深，可以看到更多机械背景的细节。\n*   **光影/风格:** 地面反射出冷光，强调“力量感”。\n\n#### **KF6**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 侧拍特写 (Profile Close-Up)\n*   **构图:** 从人物的侧面拍摄，展示双马尾的发丝流动感和侧脸轮廓。手部在画面的一侧。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 头部微微转动，配合手部动作，展示侧面风情。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头轻微左右横摇 (Pan)，跟随头部转动。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 侧光勾勒出脸部轮廓和发丝的高光。\n\n#### **KF7**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 肩部以上特写 (Over the Shoulder)\n*   **构图:** 模拟观众视角，手部在镜头前，仿佛观众的手被覆盖。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 手部动作更加急促，手指交错摆动。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头位置极低，贴近地面，产生仰视和压迫感。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，中景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 强调手部的动态模糊 (Motion Blur)。\n\n#### **KF8**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 正面中景 (Medium Shot)\n*   **构图:** 回归正面视角，但人物距离镜头更近。手部占据画面左侧三分之一。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 手部动作幅度减小，手指恢复平稳，准备进入下一个循环。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头缓慢拉远 (Dolly Out)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 35mm，中景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 光线柔和，恢复整体氛围。\n\n#### **KF9**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 正面近景 (Medium Close-Up)\n*   **构图:** 人物居中，手部在前景虚化，作为前景框架。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 手部动作停止，人物直视镜头，眼神变得柔和或带有一丝挑逗。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头稳定不动，焦点从手部移回人物面部。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 面部打光柔和，强调眼神光。\n\n#### **KF10**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 正面特写 (Close-Up)\n*   **构图:** 画面聚焦于人物面部，手部已移出画面或仅在极边缘模糊可见。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 眨眼，微笑或眼神变化，展示最完美的表情。\n*   **摄影:** 缓慢推近 (Slow Push In)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，非常浅的景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 完美的电影级人像光效。\n\n#### **KF11**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 正面大特写 (Extreme Close-Up)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦于眼部和鼻尖的特写。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 眼神凝视，仿佛穿透了屏幕。\n*   **摄影:** 镜头定格 (Static)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 135mm，极浅景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 极致的人像质感，强调细节。\n\n#### **KF12**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s | **景别:** 正面中景 (Medium Shot)\n*   **构图:** 画面回到中景，人物姿态放松，手部自然垂下或放在身侧。\n*   **动作/节拍:** 动作结束，人物摆出一个自然的结束姿势。\n*   **摄影:** 缓慢拉远 (Slow Pull Out) 至初始构图。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 35mm，中景深。\n*   **光影/风格:** 场景逐渐变暗，营造结束感。\n\n---\n\n### E) 一张接触图 (Master Contact Sheet)\n\n这是一张包含上述所有12个关键帧的接触图，展示了完整的分镜序列。\n\n![Master Contact Sheet](https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Storyboard%20Grid%2012%20panels%2016%3A9%20Cinematic%20Shot%20Sequence%20female%20cosplay%20blue%20pigtails%20cyberpunk%20industrial%20background%20hand%20gesture%20extreme%20close-up%20wide%20shot%20storyboard%20grid%20cinematic%20lighting%20realistic%20texture%20no%20text%20clean%20white%20background%20for%20AI%20video%20generation%20high%20quality?width=1024&height=576&nolog=true&seed=12345)"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 601, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 405, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [597], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-686.1622314453125, 12446.8583984375], "widgets_values": ["16:9"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 411, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [375.14813232421875, 58], "pos": [-694.1578979492188, 12262.986328125], "widgets_values": [2.0000000000000004], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 429, "type": "Float", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [616], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [465.3110046386719, 304.7049865722656], "pos": [-217.2401123046875, 12133.91015625], "widgets_values": ["You are an award-winning trailer director + cinematographer + storyboard artist.\nYour job: turn ONE reference image into a cohesive cinematic short sequence, then output AI-video-ready keyframes.\n\nUser provides: one reference image (image).\n\nComposition Analysis: First, analyze the full composition: identify ALL key subjects (person/group/vehicle/object/animal/props/environment elements) and describe spatial relationships and interactions (left/right/foreground/background, facing direction, what each is doing).\nTruthfulness: Do NOT guess real identities, exact real-world locations, or brand ownership. Stick to visible facts. Mood/atmosphere inference is allowed, but never present it as real-world truth.\nStrict Continuity: Maintain strict continuity across ALL shots: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same time-of-day and lighting style. Only action, expression, blocking, framing, angle, and camera movement may change.\nDepth of Field: Must be realistic: deeper in wides, shallower in close-ups with natural bokeh.\nColor Grade: Keep ONE consistent cinematic color grade across the entire sequence.\nNo New Elements: Do NOT introduce new characters/objects not present in the reference image. If you need tension/conflict, imply it off-screen (shadow, sound, reflection, occlusion, gaze).\n\nExpand the image into a 10–20 second cinematic clip with a clear theme and emotional progression (setup → build → turn → payoff). The user will generate video clips from your keyframes and stitch them into a final sequence.\n\nOutput (with clear subheadings):\nSubjects: List each key subject (A/B/C…), describe visible traits (wardrobe/material/form), relative positions, facing direction, action/state, and any interaction.\nEnvironment & Lighting: Interior/exterior, spatial layout, background elements, ground/walls/materials, light direction & quality (hard/soft; key/fill/rim), implied time-of-day, 3–8 vibe keywords.\nVisual Anchors: List 3–6 visual traits that must stay constant across all shots (palette, signature prop, key light source, weather/fog/rain, grain/texture, background markers).\n\nFrom the image, propose:\nTheme: One sentence.\nLogline: One restrained trailer-style sentence grounded in what the image can support.\nEmotional Arc: 4 beats (setup/build/turn/payoff), one line each.\n\nChoose and explain your filmmaking approach (must include):\nShot progression strategy: How you move from wide to close (or reverse) to serve the beats.\nCamera movement plan: Push/pull/pan/dolly/track/orbit/handheld micro-shake/gimbal—and WHY.\nLens & exposure suggestions: Focal length range (18/24/35/50/85mm etc.), DoF tendency (shallow/medium/deep), shutter \"feel\" (cinematic vs documentary).\nLight & color: Contrast, key tones, material rendering priorities, optional grain (must match the reference style).\n\nOutput a Keyframe List: default 9–12 frames (later assembled into ONE master grid). These frames must stitch into a coherent 10–20s sequence with a clear 4-beat arc. Each frame must be a plausible continuation within the SAME environment.\n\nUse this exact format per frame:\n[KF# | suggested duration (sec) | shot type (ELS/LS/MLS/MS/MCU/CU/ECU/Low/Worm's-eye/High/Bird's-eye/Insert)]\nComposition: Subject placement, foreground/mid/background, leading lines, gaze direction.\nAction/beat: What visibly happens (simple, executable).\nCamera: Height, angle, movement (e.g., slow 5% push-in / 1m lateral move / subtle handheld).\nLens/DoF: Focal length (mm), DoF (shallow/medium/deep), focus target.\nLighting & grade: Keep consistent; call out highlight/shadow emphasis.\nSound/atmos (optional): One line (wind, city hum, footsteps, metal creak) to support editing rhythm.\n\nHard requirements:\nMust include: 1 environment-establishing wide, 1 intimate close-up, 1 extreme detail ECU, and 1 power-angle shot (low or high).\nEnsure edit-motivated continuity between shots (eyeline match, action continuation, consistent screen direction / axis).\n\nYou MUST additionally output ONE single master image: a Cinematic Contact Sheet / Storyboard Grid containing ALL keyframes in one large image.\nGrid Layout: Default 3x3. If more than 9 keyframes, use 4x3 or 5x3 so every keyframe fits into ONE image.\nContent: The single master image must include every keyframe as a separate panel (one shot per cell) for easy selection.\nLabeling: Each panel must be clearly labeled: KF number + shot type + suggested duration (labels placed in safe margins, never covering the subject).\nContinuity: Strict continuity across ALL panels: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same lighting & same cinematic color grade; only action/expression/blocking/framing/movement changes.\nRealism: DoF shifts realistically: shallow in close-ups, deeper in wides; photoreal textures and consistent grading.\nFollow-up: After the master grid image, 